---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About | JayTech9"
  description="JayTech9 is an Accra-based technology company building websites, business systems, data dashboards and AgriTech tools for businesses, nonprofits and farmers in Ghana and around the world."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Technology that fits how your business works</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        JayTech9 helps businesses, nonprofits and farmers work faster with simple, well-made software.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap story">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Our story</h2>
        <p>
          JayTech9 grew out of agricultural field work. Training smallholder farmers in sustainable
          agriculture and running cereal quality checks meant long days of paperwork: the same figures copied
          into forms, notebooks and reports, again and again.
        </p>
        <p>
          Automating that work led to building tools for others with the same problem: shops tracking stock in
          exercise books, nonprofits counting donations by hand, and field teams reporting over WhatsApp.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today JayTech9 builds websites, business systems and data dashboards for clients in Ghana and
          abroad, and is developing BuildSmart, its own software for hardware and building material
          businesses.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="story__art">
        <svg class="contours" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <circle cx="40" cy="560" r="18" class="contours__dot"></circle>
          <path
            d="M 110 560 A 70 70 0 0 0 40 490"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
            style="--delay:0ms"
          ></path>
          <path
            d="M 158 560 A 118 118 0 0 0 40 442"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
            style="--delay:70ms"
          ></path>
          <path
            d="M 206 560 A 166 166 0 0 0 40 394"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
            style="--delay:140ms"
          ></path>
          <path
            d="M 254 560 A 214 214 0 0 0 40 346"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
            style="--delay:210ms"
          ></path>
          <path
            d="M 302 560 A 262 262 0 0 0 40 298"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
            style="--delay:280ms"
          ></path>
          <path
            d="M 350 560 A 310 310 0 0 0 40 250"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
            style="--delay:350ms"
          ></path>
          <path
            d="M 398 560 A 358 358 0 0 0 40 202"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
            style="--delay:420ms"
          ></path>
          <path
            d="M 446 560 A 406 406 0 0 0 40 154"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
            style="--delay:490ms"
          ></path>
          <path
            d="M 494 560 A 454 454 0 0 0 40 106"
            pathLength="1"
            class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
            style="--delay:560ms"
          ></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--band" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="principles-heading">How we work</h2>
      <ul class="card-grid card-grid--2 principles">
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34" />
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Start with the real problem</h3>
          <p>
            We ask how the work is done today before suggesting any software. Sometimes the answer is a better
            spreadsheet, and we’ll say so.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20" />
              <path d="M2 12h20" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Built for real-world conditions</h3>
          <p>
            Pages that load fast on mobile data, local payment methods such as mobile money, local taxes built
            in, and screens that make sense to staff who aren’t technical.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z" />
              <circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>You own what you pay for</h3>
          <p>
            Your domain is registered in your name, your data stays yours, and you receive the code and logins
            at handover.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Plain answers</h3>
          <p>
            Clear quotes in your currency, honest timelines, and no jargon. If something will cost more or
            take longer, you hear it from us first.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="expertise-heading">
    <div class="wrap facts">
      <div>
        <h2 id="expertise-heading">What we bring</h2>
        <p class="muted">
          Skills across software, data and agriculture, backed by training in ICT, data analytics, AI and
          networking.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="expertise">
        <li>Web and software development</li>
        <li>Data analytics and reporting</li>
        <li>AI and automation</li>
        <li>Networking and IT security</li>
        <li>Sustainable and regenerative agriculture</li>
        <li>Brand and print design</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap company">
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt>Registered name</dt>
          <dd>Jay Tech 9 Enterprise</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Based in</dt>
          <dd>Accra, Ghana</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Serving</dt>
          <dd>Clients worldwide, online and on site</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="contact-band" aria-labelledby="contact-band-heading">
    <div class="wrap contact-band__inner">
      <div class="contact-band__text">
        <h2 id="contact-band-heading">Tell us what slows your business down</h2>
        <p>
          Start with a free 30-minute call. We’ll listen, suggest what would help, and send a written quote
          with a clear timeline.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button contact-band__primary" href="/contact/">
            Book a free call
          </a>
          <a class="button button--quiet contact-band__quiet" href="https://wa.me/233203651974">
            Chat on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <svg class="contours contact-band__art" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <circle cx="40" cy="560" r="18" class="contours__dot"></circle>
        <path
          d="M 110 560 A 70 70 0 0 0 40 490"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
          style="--delay:0ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 158 560 A 118 118 0 0 0 40 442"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
          style="--delay:70ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 206 560 A 166 166 0 0 0 40 394"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
          style="--delay:140ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 254 560 A 214 214 0 0 0 40 346"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
          style="--delay:210ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 302 560 A 262 262 0 0 0 40 298"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
          style="--delay:280ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 350 560 A 310 310 0 0 0 40 250"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
          style="--delay:350ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 398 560 A 358 358 0 0 0 40 202"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
          style="--delay:420ms"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .contours {
    width: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .contours__arc {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5px;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }
  .contours__arc--blue {
    stroke: var(--blue);
  }
  .contours__arc--green {
    stroke: var(--green);
    stroke-width: 4px;
  }
  .contours__dot {
    fill: var(--green);
  }
  .contours--animate .contours__arc {
    stroke-dasharray: 1;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1px;
    animation: 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.3, 0.6, 0.2, 1) forwards draw;
    animation-delay: var(--delay);
  }
  @keyframes draw {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .contours--animate .contours__arc {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
      animation: none;
    }
  }
  .contact-band {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: var(--white);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .contact-band__inner {
    align-items: end;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    display: grid;
  }
  .contact-band__text {
    max-width: 34rem;
  }
  .contact-band h2 {
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .contact-band p {
    color: #dcecf5;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block: 1.25rem 2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .contact-band__primary {
    background: var(--white);
    border-color: var(--white);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .contact-band__primary:hover {
    background: var(--paper);
    border-color: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .contact-band__quiet {
    color: var(--white);
    border-color: var(--white);
  }
  .contact-band__quiet:hover {
    background: var(--white);
    border-color: var(--white);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .contact-band .contact-band__art {
    display: none;
  }
  .contact-band .contact-band__art .contours__arc--blue {
    stroke: #4d9cc8;
  }
  @media (width>=52rem) {
    .contact-band__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    }
    .contact-band .contact-band__art {
      justify-self: end;
      max-width: 22rem;
      margin-bottom: -6rem;
      display: block;
    }
  }
  .story {
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem 5rem;
    display: grid;
  }
  .story__art {
    display: none;
  }
  .principles {
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
  .facts {
    gap: 2rem 5rem;
    display: grid;
  }
  .facts h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .facts p {
    max-width: 40ch;
  }
  .expertise {
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .expertise li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    padding-block: 0.9rem;
  }
  .company dl {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(13rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem 2rem;
    margin: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 0 0;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
  }
  .company dt {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .company dd {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .team {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 13rem), 1fr));
    gap: 2.5rem 2rem;
    margin: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
  }
  .team__photo,
  .team__initials {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .team__photo {
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .team__initials {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    place-items: center;
    display: grid;
  }
  .team__role {
    color: var(--green-deep);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .team__bio {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }
  .team__join {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  @media (width>=52rem) {
    .story {
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    }
    .story__art {
      justify-self: end;
      max-width: 22rem;
      display: block;
    }
    .facts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
